WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.607 --> 00:00:03.471
- [Narrator] Sweden's largest
internet service provider

00:00:03.471 --> 00:00:06.402
is located somewhere you might not expect,

00:00:06.402 --> 00:00:10.569
below 100 feet of bedrock
in a former nuclear bunker.

00:00:15.543 --> 00:00:17.499
The Pionen Data Center
houses some of the most

00:00:17.499 --> 00:00:19.815
sensitive information in the world,

00:00:19.815 --> 00:00:22.789
which once included Wikileaks servers.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.959
They can help protect
their clients information

00:00:24.959 --> 00:00:27.811
under Sweden's Free Speech Act.

00:00:27.811 --> 00:00:31.162
Inside engines intended to
be for German submarines

00:00:31.162 --> 00:00:33.919
are used as backup generators.

00:00:33.919 --> 00:00:37.513
The design and style is the
work of CEO, Jon Karlung,

00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:41.045
who took inspiration
from his love of films.

00:00:41.045 --> 00:00:43.667
He says that the choice
to put plants in the caves

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:46.000
was to capture the
computer meets plants vibe

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.099
of sci-fi films from the ’70's.

00:00:49.099 --> 00:00:51.546
The plants are kept alive by grow lights.

00:00:51.546 --> 00:00:53.362
The center has simulated daylight

00:00:53.362 --> 00:00:54.434
and the waterfall,

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:57.033
well that's just for fun.

00:00:57.033 --> 00:00:59.839
And while it may look like a
villain's lair from James Bond

00:00:59.839 --> 00:01:02.064
you won't find Goldfinger here,

00:01:02.064 --> 00:01:06.231
just the 15 senior technical
staff who run the servers.

